{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "019f0e79-810e-7280-adeb-83afce3051d3", "team_id": "contest2026_004_TeamFalcons", "github_login": "Foleaf", "tool": "codex", "seq": 235, "ts": "2026-06-30T14:24:07.016Z", "phase": "final_answer", "role": "assistant", "text": "**严谨版教程**\n\n结论先放前面：**写代码只进 `contest2026_004_TeamFalcons/`，编译才进 `openvela/nuttx/`。**  \n`openvela/nuttx` 是构建现场，不是作品代码目录。\n\n这次我们用最稳的竞赛合规方式：在你的参赛仓 `app/hello_app/` 里写一个 `first_led` 应用，调用 NuttX 标准板级 LED API。暂时不改 `nuttx/boards/...`，不改 `packages/`，不改 `vendor/`。\n\n**1. 你的经验如何迁移**\n\n```text\nSTM32 HAL:\nMX_GPIO_Init()\nHAL_GPIO_WritePin(...)\n\nopenvela/NuttX:\n板级代码已经定义 LED GPIO\n应用调用 board_userled_initialize()\n应用调用 board_userled(0, true)\n```\n\n类比关系：\n\n```text\nFreeRTOS vTaskDelay()  -> usleep()\nCubeMX 配置            -> Kconfig / defconfig\nmain.c                 -> app/xxx/xxx_main.c\n串口 shell             -> NSH\n```\n\n**2. 只在参赛仓写代码**\n\n进入你的仓库：\n\n```bash\ncd /home/debian19y/openvela/contest2026_004_TeamFalcons\n```\n\n修改 [hello_app_main.c](/home/debian19y/openvela/contest2026_004_TeamFalcons/app/hello_app/hello_app_main.c:1)：\n\n```c\n#include <nuttx/board.h>\n\n#include <stdbool.h>\n#include <stdint.h>\n#include <stdio.h>\n#include <unistd.h>\n\n#define FIRST_LED 0\n\nint main(int argc, char *argv[])\n{\n  uint32_t nleds = board_userled_initialize();\n\n  if (nleds == 0)\n    {\n      printf(\"first_led: no user LED available\\n\");\n      return 1;\n    }\n\n  printf(\"first_led: blink LED %d, total LEDs: %lu\\n\",\n         FIRST_LED, (unsigned long)nleds);\n\n  for (int i = 0; i < 5; i++)\n    {\n      board_userled(FIRST_LED, true);\n      usleep(500 * 1000);\n\n      board_userled(FIRST_LED, false);\n      usleep(500 * 1000);\n    }\n\n  board_userled(FIRST_LED, true);\n  printf(\"first_led: LED %d left ON\\n\", FIRST_LED);\n\n  return 0;\n}\n```\n\n**3. 把模板里的队伍号改严谨**\n\n你的目录映射是 `contest2026_004_hello_app`，所以 Kconfig/Makefile 里的 `000` 应该改成 `004`。\n\n[app/hello_app/Kconfig](/home/debian19y/openvela/contest2026_004_TeamFalcons/app/hello_app/Kconfig:1)：\n\n```text\nconfig LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_004_HELLO_APP\n\tbool \"Contest 2026 team 004 first LED app\"\n\tdefault n\n\t---help---\n\t\tEnable the first LED demo for contest 2026 team 004.\n```\n\n[app/hello_app/Makefile](/home/debian19y/openvela/contest2026_004_TeamFalcons/app/hello_app/Makefile:1) 关键处：\n\n```make\nPROGNAME  = first_led\nPRIORITY  = SCHED_PRIORITY_DEFAULT\nSTACKSIZE = 2048\nMODULE    = $(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_004_HELLO_APP)\n\nMAINSRC = hello_app_main.c\n```\n\n[app/hello_app/Make.defs](/home/debian19y/openvela/contest2026_004_TeamFalcons/app/hello_app/Make.defs:1)：\n\n```make\nifneq ($(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_004_HELLO_APP),)\nCONFIGURED_APPS += $(APPDIR)/packages/demos/contest2026_004_hello_app\nendif\n```\n\n[app/hello_app/CMakeLists.txt](/home/debian19y/openvela/contest2026_004_TeamFalcons/app/hello_app/CMakeLists.txt:1)：\n\n```cmake\nif(CONFIG_LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_004_HELLO_APP)\n  nuttx_add_application(\n    NAME first_led\n    SRCS hello_app_main.c\n    STACKSIZE 2048)\nendif()\n```\n\n**4. 进入 openvela/nuttx 只是为了构建**\n\n```bash\ncd /home/debian19y/openvela/nuttx\n./tools/configure.sh stm32h750b-dk:lvgl\nmake menuconfig\n```\n\n在 `menuconfig` 里搜索并启用：\n\n```text\nLVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_004_HELLO_APP\n```\n\n注意：保存的是本地 `.config`，这可以；**不要执行 `make savedefconfig`**，否则可能把配置写回 `nuttx/boards/.../defconfig`，这就踩到生产仓库修改边界了。\n\n然后编译：\n\n```bash\nmake -j$(nproc)\n```\n\n**5. 烧录**\n\n```bash\nSTM32_Programmer_CLI -c port=SWD mode=UR reset=HWrst freq=4000 \\\n  -e all -w nuttx.hex -v -rst\n```\n\n**6. 串口运行**\n\n```bash\nsudo minicom -D /dev/ttyACM0 -b 115200\n```\n\n进 NSH 后执行：\n\n```text\nnsh> first_led\n```\n\n你应该看到第一盏 LED 闪 5 次，最后保持点亮。\n\n**7. 提交前检查边界**\n\n只应该看到你的参赛仓有改动：\n\n```bash\ngit -C /home/debian19y/openvela/contest2026_004_TeamFalcons status --short\n```\n\n生产仓库不要有你为了点灯留下的改动，尤其是：\n\n```text\n/home/debian19y/openvela/nuttx\n/home/debian19y/openvela/packages\n/home/debian19y/openvela/vendor\n```\n\n这个版本的教程是竞赛合规优先：**应用在参赛仓，构建在 openvela，生产仓零改动。**"}
